  "description": "Connects the OASIS to Axelar Network -- the general-purpose cross-chain communication protocol enabling arbitrary cross-chain calls between any chain. OASIS holons and avatars can execute cross-chain logic across Ethereum, Cosmos, Avalanche, BNB Chain, and 50+ networks. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one",
