  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.AxelarOASIS v2.0.3\n\nConnects the OASIS to Axelar Network -- the general-purpose cross-chain communication protocol enabling arbitrary cross-chain calls between any chain. OASIS holons and avatars can execute cross-chain logic across Ethereum, Cosmos, Avalanche, BNB Chain, and 50+ networks. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.2\n- docs: add README.md for 57 providers + bump submodule pointers (87b2b85)\n- feat: add 11 new OASIS providers — Maps (4), Blockchain (2), Network (3), Storage (2) (e1538d7)\n- feat(AxelarOASIS): track Axelar GMP calls and transfers via Axelarscan (519bda9)\n- fix: resolve all build errors in 11 new OASIS providers (2d0a601)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Blockchain/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.AxelarOASIS",
